WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.181
Rachel: Mom, where is Grandma going?

2
00:00:06.182 --> 00:00:09.850
Mom: She is going to visit a friend in Forestwood.

3
00:00:09.851 --> 00:00:12.702
Rachel: Why are we visiting her then?

4
00:00:12.703 --> 00:00:16.067
Ricky: Because we have to pick up her

5
00:00:16.068 --> 00:00:24.810
dog. Ricky & Rachel: Hi,

6
00:00:24.811 --> 00:00:35.584
Grandma! Grandma: Hello, my darlings. It’s so nice to see

7
00:00:35.585 --> 00:00:41.240
you. Ricky: Hello,

8
00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:45.831
Bingo! Rachel: I want to play

9
00:00:45.832 --> 00:00:52.564
too. Grandma: Ricky, Rachel! Come inside for cookies and

10
00:00:52.565 --> 00:00:58.067
milk. Rachel: It’s nice to see you too,

11
00:00:58.068 --> 00:01:03.050
Bingo. Dad: How long will you

12
00:01:03.051 --> 00:01:06.406
be gone? Grandma: I’ll be gone for

13
00:01:06.407 --> 00:01:12.657
two weeks. This is Bingo’s food. He gets fed twice a

14
00:01:12.658 --> 00:01:16.237
day. I take him for a walk in the evening.

15
00:01:16.238 --> 00:01:18.441
Ricky: Can I feed him now?

16
00:01:18.442 --> 00:01:24.603
Grandma: Yes. But not too much, Ricky.

17
00:01:24.604 --> 00:01:27.723
Rachel: Bingo! Come here,

18
00:01:27.724 --> 00:01:32.349
Bingo. I want to play with you.

19
00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:35.489
Grandma: Bingo! Bad dog!

20
00:01:35.490 --> 00:01:38.777
Ricky: Rachel! Don’t bother the dog.

21
00:01:38.778 --> 00:01:44.128
Rachel: He-he-he! Sorry, Ricky.

